# Publish Skill (AgentOS)

## Prerequisites

- Agent registered: `agentos agent resolve <name.sui>`
- Manifest JSON at `sui-agent-skill/v1` (see `examples/skill.manifest.json`)

## CLI

```bash
agentos skill publish ./skill.manifest.json --agent <name.sui> --walrus <blob-id> --json
```

Use `--dry-run` to preview `SkillDescriptor::create` transaction bytes.

## MCP

Tool `agentos_publish_skill` with `agentName` and `manifestJson`.

## Dashboard

Manage versions at `/agent/<slug>` (MVR-style list).
